webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4e95667b5ca06982d148ce101d4f8d58, https://si.imgix.net/53fbe1ed/uploads/origins/4774f346-e6ea-4408-83f9-ad39c04b5cba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5706b46a090f60259f9224e8bd12e38b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/53fbe1ed/uploads/origins/4774f346-e6ea-4408-83f9-ad39c04b5cba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d00684e8c09d800c4f17a6f7b4f88530 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I would love it if you drew my original character, Innocent Euangelos.\n\nHe's normally a kind character, yet keeps to himself because of what he was forced to become. When he thinks of those who had harmed the supposedly blessed angel bound to him, an unnatural hatred occurs within him that he doesn't wish to have.\nHe was truly merged with the soul of a false god, the Lightwarden Innocence, at birth, making it be two people in one body. He believes that he is the only person he can trust, trying to form a bond with him. However, using the power granted by this slowly shortens the time he has left as himself. He will only be a vessel and will no longer be himself at all eventually.\n\nYou can put him in any pose and give him any expression.\n\nThe other two images in the folder are just meant to be used as possible inspiration.\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kuAaMtDaf8MisH2YhR7I4fEMRb1dKNpO?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@derugure/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1708206, "client_id": 1533975, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ad41d0a7/uploads/origins/ac68d30c-7e00-4bfe-8d18-f250df20ee08?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fed8d99b07fbda8279922d676ad3247", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ad41d0a7/uploads/origins/ac68d30c-7e00-4bfe-8d18-f250df20ee08?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fed8d99b07fbda8279922d676ad3247, https://si.imgix.net/ad41d0a7/uploads/origins/ac68d30c-7e00-4bfe-8d18-f250df20ee08?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b6b69fd3a3db0390b756c608d4e4582d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ad41d0a7/uploads/origins/ac68d30c-7e00-4bfe-8d18-f250df20ee08?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e30fbb09dba4eebae9b5a885f011739d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ad41d0a7/uploads/origins/ac68d30c-7e00-4bfe-8d18-f250df20ee08?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f38dd63745c37ba0d1d2116a8f51867c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ad41d0a7/uploads/origins/ac68d30c-7e00-4bfe-8d18-f250df20ee08?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f38dd63745c37ba0d1d2116a8f51867c, https://si.imgix.net/ad41d0a7/uploads/origins/ac68d30c-7e00-4bfe-8d18-f250df20ee08?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aba9b343dcdcce9e6ec36cb3898bb97c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ad41d0a7/uploads/origins/ac68d30c-7e00-4bfe-8d18-f250df20ee08?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5923c7f501bf6543f5343fb42476a321 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I hope you are having a great day, deg-san. \n\nYour art style is amazing and unique.\n\nIf possible, I'd like to see Isabeau de Baviere (\u30a4\u30b6\u30dc\u30fc\u30fb\u30c9\u30fb\u30d0\u30f4\u30a3\u30a8\u30fc\u30eb ) from \u30de\u30ae\u30a2\u30ec\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9 in your art style. She's a mature queen type of character who is kind to her daughters and animals, but cruel and intimidating to enemies. She held a motherly love for her daughters until she witched out. Since France and the king only saw her as a political tool and a decoration, eventually Isabeau planned revenge on the entire country. Since this is Isabeau before witching out, I like to see her expression being healthy, maybe an evil smirk, as if she is looking towards an enemy.\n\nWith that information being said, I will leave the rest of the details up to you. \n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nReference: https://wiki.puella-magi.net/Isabeau", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@derugure/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c46a0886/uploads/origins/385e3319-9bda-4f29-92ee-0ffbbdcd1618?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=237e97ed3aabde4f05ea692734f8d999", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c46a0886/uploads/origins/385e3319-9bda-4f29-92ee-0ffbbdcd1618?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=237e97ed3aabde4f05ea692734f8d999, https://si.imgix.net/c46a0886/uploads/origins/385e3319-9bda-4f29-92ee-0ffbbdcd1618?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cbe11d58b09c5ee9be1b707e1b02cacf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c46a0886/uploads/origins/385e3319-9bda-4f29-92ee-0ffbbdcd1618?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=39b9b37ce75138d7d2143c6345a3d373 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1708206, "client_id": 1627681, "nc": 145}, {"path": "/@derugure/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "