agon tattoo on one arm. He paints his fingernails black. It's a little hard to see but he has amber brown eyes. If his mouth is open, he has a tongue piercing. Thank you so much and please take care!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vu-LPB1iZ-dSNK7GlKcRh4DpCO1Qz0p4?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@derugure/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1708206, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc51a455/uploads/origins/6b23b4ea-349e-43d8-b085-ea7a40370dea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=546b82f539fc72f9490265748d71bf08", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bc51a455/uploads/origins/6b23b4ea-349e-43d8-b085-ea7a40370dea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=546b82f539fc72f9490265748d71bf08, https://si.imgix.net/bc51a455/uploads/origins/6b23b4ea-349e-43d8-b085-ea7a40370dea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0386ba6380230c4b2be97685a0237ea 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bc51a455/uploads/origins/6b23b4ea-349e-43d8-b085-ea7a40370dea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5cf9111d6bec9b85cbb691b4939ad521 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc51a455/uploads/origins/6b23b4ea-349e-43d8-b085-ea7a40370dea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=710aaafe27754c6ad276f529d64fe35b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bc51a455/uploads/origins/6b23b4ea-349e-43d8-b085-ea7a40370dea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=710aaafe27754c6ad276f529d64fe35b, https://si.imgix.net/bc51a455/uploads/origins/6b23b4ea-349e-43d8-b085-ea7a40370dea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6c7e0bbf9e4ae114a30d56ac2cc1aa19 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bc51a455/uploads/origins/6b23b4ea-349e-43d8-b085-ea7a40370dea?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0b9b4feebb401fbc63fed88a6bce94cb 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you. I always enjoy your BSD illustrations.\nI am always amazed at the range of your expressive ability, from heartwarming four-panel comic strips to serious illustrations.\nI especially like the trickster-like Gogol, the lovely and fragile Sigma, the beautiful but charming Tatsuhiko Shibusawa, and the mysterious and fascinating Dostoevsky. I also liked Agatha's graceful paintings that she used to draw.\n\nThe genre of the character you would like to request is original, gender is female, age is late 20s, height is 165-170cm, tall and thin.\nHer appearance is neutral, with an air of fragility and transparency, but not fragility.\nShe has a light hair color in the platinum blonde or ash blonde range, and her eyes are a translucent light blue rather than dark blue, giving the impression of being from a snowy European country.\nShe has a gentle personality and often smiles quietly; she is a beautiful woman who looks like a thorn removed from Agatha of BSD and has combat skills.\nShe has a similar vibe to BSD's Shibusawa and Dostoevsky, and looks more doll-like and beautiful than pretty enough to make you want to protect her.\n\nImage illustration created by picrew \"MY DOLL MAKER\nhttps://picrew.me/image_maker/610761/complete?cd=A20iGPdEuU\nWithout outerwear\nhttps://picrew.me/image_maker/610761/complete?cd=GwSnFRs07Q\nPlease change the details according to deg's style.\nI'm not very good at assembling the parts, so it's hard to tell, but she wears a corset around her waist, and the overall silhouette is as sleek as DeadApple's fortifications.\n\nHair color image\nhttps://arine.jp/articles/22628\nThe length of the hair is about waist-length, but it can be changed according to the composition of the illustration.\n\nI have mentioned the name of the BSD character in the image because it is the only genre of BSD that I have seen and know from deg's illustrations, but it is not a character in the image of a copyrighted character.\n\nWell then, please do so.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@derugure/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1708206, "client_id": 1627681, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e9eaffe7/uploads/origins/b4834180-836b-4383-bc64-5ec3b34801d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02974131f2fe4fba79aaf3cb5b52587e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e9eaffe7/uploads/origins/b4834180-836b-4383-bc64-5ec3b34801d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02974131f2fe4fba79aaf3cb5b52587e, https://si.imgix.net/e9eaffe7/uploads/origins/b4834180-836b-4383-bc64-5ec3b34801d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0de1b0b2cddf7e226d4a0c612705c3a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e9eaffe7/uploads/origins/b4834180-836b-4383-bc64-5ec3b34801d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=45661339b59c556a1b69827ac9aefa56 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e9eaffe7/uploads/origins/b4834180-836b-4383-bc64-5ec3b34801d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=551a9e5bcd612133bfe819b1c21ba822", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e9eaffe7/uploads/origins/b4834180-836b-4383-bc64-5ec3b34801d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=551a9e5bcd612133bfe819b1c21ba822, https://si.imgix.net/e9eaffe7/uploads/origins/b4834180-836b-4383-bc64-5ec3b34801d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a197e4cc657f32fea38a10a54593cc78 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e9eaffe7/uploads/origins/b4834180-836b-4383-bc64-5ec3b34801d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3382c48368b888e5804db463a67c491e 3x"}, "body": "Hi!\nI find your art style VERY suitable for this character and was wondering if you could draw a this piece for me.\n\nPlease draw my character \u30b3\u30cf\u30eb with \u30b9\u30af\u30a2\u30fc\u30ed from \u5bb6\u5ead\u6559\u5e2b\u30d2\u30c3\u30c8\u30de\u30f3REBORN!\nTheir height difference is about 3/4 of a head.\nPlease draw something similar to the pose reference given!\nExpressions are up to you, the mood overall should be cheerful and exciting.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/V5c1OQg", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@derugure/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1708206, "client_id": 417772, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e8ef498a/uploads/origins/be27fc2b-5836-4834-b59b-95b5a673b7ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=104bc2fd2885cfd4a05a06ac66db4954", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e8ef498a/uploads/origins/be27fc2b-5836-4834-b59b-95b5a673b7ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=104bc2fd2885cfd4a05a06ac66db4954, https://si.imgix.net/e8ef498a/uploads/origins/be27fc2b-5836-4834-b59b-95b5a673b7ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=683280adb3d2d0f0ab1151145dac8d23 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e8ef498a/uploads/origins/be27fc2b-5836-4834-b59b-95b5a673b7ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c88aeba7237aa49f5f0845c906cedb67 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "h