es to hide her pointed ears with her head dress. Feel free to draw her with or without her headgear!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/2192723.sehanine", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@derugure/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1708206, "client_id": 1539183, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cb34cb7/uploads/origins/c2a29bae-a4c6-49b1-b7fa-b9ccdcc0c293?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67bac89f08fcaed63143f7891fac0d3d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cb34cb7/uploads/origins/c2a29bae-a4c6-49b1-b7fa-b9ccdcc0c293?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67bac89f08fcaed63143f7891fac0d3d, https://si.imgix.net/3cb34cb7/uploads/origins/c2a29bae-a4c6-49b1-b7fa-b9ccdcc0c293?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b62dd56dee2a7e0de04ee1a58a7e84da 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3cb34cb7/uploads/origins/c2a29bae-a4c6-49b1-b7fa-b9ccdcc0c293?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=961d3cd3f53e43b39eaccdac022e64ed 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cb34cb7/uploads/origins/c2a29bae-a4c6-49b1-b7fa-b9ccdcc0c293?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=be25ae6c4b11176bfb6763c3ecdbf9d7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cb34cb7/uploads/origins/c2a29bae-a4c6-49b1-b7fa-b9ccdcc0c293?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=be25ae6c4b11176bfb6763c3ecdbf9d7, https://si.imgix.net/3cb34cb7/uploads/origins/c2a29bae-a4c6-49b1-b7fa-b9ccdcc0c293?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=716f2300655945436ebf6f37fc4ed58a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3cb34cb7/uploads/origins/c2a29bae-a4c6-49b1-b7fa-b9ccdcc0c293?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=45f549e48ced9d0847fa534e8168d7fc 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I would really love it if you drew my character. \n\nHis name is Valia Cassius. He is 190 cm tall without his heels on and 28 years old. He's a very charismatic, dramatic, and eccentric person with a prominent sadistic streak. Aside from violence, he likes games, costumes, theatre, and dancing. His aura is someone that is playful but very dangerous beneath the surface.\n\nIn all honesty, I'm a huge Kolya fan and I love the way you portray him! Your art was a big inspiration for certain parts of Valia's personality. The pose is entirely up to you, but I've attached some extra reference photos in the Google Drive folder in case you need some inspiration. Don't feel obligated to include the weapon unless you want to. It's difficult to tell in the photos, but he has a small heart tattoo under his left eye that is the same colour as his hair. \n\nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DrpvzP1BKo1CqIH1DWQDpuSaaN4Ecx1I?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@derugure/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1708206, "client_id": 64097, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e2f4942f/uploads/origins/50d74f69-2caa-4a0e-bfea-3b77ba89f323?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3d18a03f983b841f4c9a48bd2a7067c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e2f4942f/uploads/origins/50d74f69-2caa-4a0e-bfea-3b77ba89f323?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3d18a03f983b841f4c9a48bd2a7067c, https://si.imgix.net/e2f4942f/uploads/origins/50d74f69-2caa-4a0e-bfea-3b77ba89f323?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1f